x="The UK PEACE model (Planning and preparation, Engage and explain, Account, Closure, Evaluate) emphasizes information gathering rather than confession seeking. Gudjonsson developed suggestibility scales (GSS) to assess vulnerability. Psychiatrists asked about a confession’s reliability must consider mental state, intellectual functioning, interrogation methods and suggestibility.",
s="Kassin et al., Law Hum Behav 2010; Gudjonsson, The Psychology of Interrogations and Confessions",
